  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.2: the vault URL is now optional and defaults to https://vault.iodream.co.uk, so only the ivs_ token is needed (AddIodreamVault(token)); passing a URL still works. 1.0.0: first public release. AddIodreamVault(url, token) loads an app's secrets for the token's environment; optional Section, App (for All apps tokens), Optional and ReloadInterval. Targets .NET 8, 9 and 10.",
